      "content": "hey my 3yo is acting really weird. he has had bad diarrhea since yesterday and just wont keep anything down. he seems super lethargic and his mouth looks kind of dry... i'm worried about dehydration but i really dont want to take him to the er at 2am if it's something i can just fix at home. can i just give him some salt tablets or something to help him hold onto the water? what's the best way to do this quickly?",
